    "result_text": "The full suite passes \u2014 `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class and both its tests are green.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented `locality` as a derived, read-only owner field following the existing derived-field pattern (`displayName`, `membershipTier`, etc.):\n\n1. **`util/LocalityResolver.java`** (new) \u2014 a small single-responsibility helper that maps a city to its canonical region via the fixed table (Sydney\u2192NSW, Melbourne\u2192VIC, Brisbane\u2192QLD), returning `\"UNKNOWN\"` for any other city. Mirrors the style of the sibling formatters/normalizers in the `util` package.\n\n2. **`mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `locality` that delegates to `LocalityResolver.resolve(owner.getCity())`, exactly like the other derived fields.\n\n3. **`resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the read-only `locality` property to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it into the `GET /api/owners/{id}` response.\n\nThe logic lives in one focused unit, is reused through the mapper rather than duplicated, and no existing class absorbed unrelated responsibility.",
